B.Sf=s(["Modified What mode, crabs and sb19 sprites will now spring up lower than previous build.","Modified Lawless mode to flow better and have a consistent sizing of the crabs and sb19 sprites.","Modified Visa approved and denied sound effects. IDK if you guys will like it though.","In-game effects now have a half-tone effect, inspired by the text on the Dungka Music Video","Some effects are now a shader so it uses the GPU instead of the CPU, which should improve performance.","Does anybody read this? Message me on your favorite social media platform and tell me what you think of the game. I'd love to hear your feedback."],t.s)
B.I3=new A.lJ("v1.9.0","Current release",B.Sf)
B.Uh=s(["Added Lawless and Visa modes to the game.","Modes such as 8tonball and What are modified to fit with the new combo system.","Bumped up version (1.8.5) because of the new Lawless and Visa modes.","Adjusted the rarity of the powers to make them more balanced.","Leaderboard and Player Profile now responds to swipe gestures to switch between tabs.","Combined combo timer and multipler with the score display to make it more compact and easier to read."],t.s)
B.I7=new A.lJ("v1.8.5","Previous release",B.Uh)
B.R0=s(["New Daily Mode - everybody gets the same set of songs!","Powers that are available for the Daily mode are Bazinga, Mana, SFTS, Crimzone, and What.","Bumped up version (1.8.0) to accommodate the new Daily mode."],t.s)
B.I9=new A.lJ("v1.8.0","Previous release",B.R0)
B.SH=s(["Performance improvements and bug fixes.","Added Pablo's cats to help tap songs and enemies","Added a longer version of the Mana song inspired by the movie Forgotten Island."],t.s)
B.I6=new A.lJ("v1.7.7","Previous release",B.SH)
B.T7=s(["Added negative combo multiplier.","Added Crab Scores tab for the negative scores leaderboard.","Added Hall of Famer tab for previous relases top scorers.","Modified Leaderboard to show up to 20 entries","Fixed Gameover screen not showing negative scores","Leaderboard reset.","Fixed audio powers not resuming after a mute and consequentially buggin the powers.","Loaded audio should now play on cue at first play.","Added new Jayat sprite to counter the negative combo multiplier.","Jayat has a flat value of 10. He can spawn from SB19 Stell sprites."],t.s)
B.I8=new A.lJ("v1.7.6","Previous release",B.T7)
B.S0=s(["Ported the game to a simple game engine for better performance and future-proofing.","Enhanced graphics and effects, including new scanline shader.","Added Settings overlay with audio, haptics, and graphics options.","Added mute button to main menu and pause overlay.","Added a combo system: consecutive crab hits build a multiplier up to x5, hitting the wrong target or letting the chain time out breaks it.","Added a changelog and power info overlay to the About screen.","Added a disclaimer overlay to the About screen.","Ported powers: Bazinga, Mana, Timer Pause, Gento, 8 Ton Ball, Wyat, What, SFTS, Crimzone, WMIAN, and Quit.","Modified the scoring system to accommodate the new combo system and powers.","Modified some power mechanics and scoring values for better balance and game feel.","Added new visual effects for some poowers and scoring events."],t.s)
